OL,3,GNEWSARepairs for listed building due to
OL,4,Abe handed over
OL,5,
OL,6,FA council is pushing ahead with repairs
OL,7,Fto a Grade II listed building despite
OL,8,Fplans to hand it over to charities.
OL,10,FWestmorland and Furness Council intends
OL,11,Fto dispose of the Nan Tait Centre on
OL,12,FAbbey Road, in Barrow.
OL,14,FCabinet members were told in July it
OL,15,Fwould go to Women's Community Matters
OL,16,Fand Art Gene through a community asset
OL,17,Ftransfer when a publicly-owned asset is
OL,18,Fhanded over for less than market value
OL,19,For at no cost.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,402,400,260,160,0,100
