OL,3,GNEWSARepairs for listed building due to
OL,4,Abe handed over
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council has now submitted proposals
OL,7,Ffor a series of fixes to the building,
OL,8,Fincluding roof repairs to the leadwork
OL,9,Fand chimney, replacement of two first
OL,10,Ffloor windows and plaster repairs.
